(University STEM\) face acute cognitive fragmentation across 5-7 disconnected tools: generic AI chatbots,) Tj
T* (static note-taking apps, flashcard makers, pomodoro timers, and exam portals. Switching contexts) Tj
T* (reduces retention and deep study focus. Furthermore, standard generalist LLMs lack academic execution) Tj
T* (environments: they output unstructured, non-standardized markdown that cannot be compiled into clean) Tj
T* (physical revision sheets, cannot run stateful interactive tests in-chat, and frequently freeze or return HTTP) Tj
T* (503/429 errors during peak study hours with no fallback. Crucially, there is no closed feedback loop) Tj
T* (connecting question mistakes to automated note-taking and spaced-repetition revision.) Tj
